<title>JAPAN: Japan November oil product imports data -- MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan November oil product imports data -- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry issued the following data on oil product imports during November (barrel equivalents are also shown):</p>
<p>	 (In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%  yr/yr %</p>
<p> Gasoline	86	  541    -28.9	+48.3</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,176     13,687    -12.1	 -8.2</p>
<p> Kerosene     212	1,333     +1.4	-15.9</p>
<p> Gas oil	 73	  459    -52.0     +108.6</p>
<p> Fuel oil A   101	  635    +20.2	+34.7</p>
<p> Fuel oil C    88	  554    -47.0	-62.1</p>
<p>(Note: LSWR imports are included in the Fuel oil C statistics)</p>
</text>
